hadiths[44]{hadithnumber,text}:
"838","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Ambiya (Alaihimussalam) allati bhai hain; un ki maayen mukhtalif hain. Main Isa bin Maryam (Alaihissalam) ka sab se ziyada haqdar hun, kyunke mere aur un ke darmiyan koi nabi nahin hai. Woh nazil honge, to unhen pahchano: woh darmiyane qad aur surkh safed rang wale honge; un ke sar se qatre tapak rahe honge agarche pani ne use chhua na ho. Woh saleeb todenge, khinzeer qatl karenge, maal par qabza karenge aur jizya khatm karenge. Allah un ke zamane mein Islam ke siwa tamam deenon ko halak farmayega. Allah kane jhoote maseeh ko halak farmayega. Allah zameen ko aman se bhar dega yahan tak ke sher oonton ke sath charenge, cheete gaayon ke sath, aur bhediye bakriyon ke sath; bachche saanpon se khelenge, aur woh ek doosre ko nuqsan nahin pahunchayenge.'"
"839","[AI-translation] Qatadah se ek aadmi se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki sanad se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind riwayat hai, lekin unhon ne us se kuch kam bayan kiya."
"840","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Hukmaran kahenge ke kaash woh Surayya (Khusha Parveen) se girte bajaye is hukumat mein se kuch qabool karne ke.' Marwan ne kaha: Maharbani farmakar mazeed wazahat farmayen. Unhon (Abu Hurairah) ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Is ummat ki halakat Quraish mein se chand jawan ladkon ke hathon hogi.'"
"841","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Zamana qareeb hai jab fitna zahir hoga; koi najaat nahin paega siwae Allah ke, ya us ke jo doobne wale ki dua ki manind dua mange.'"
"842","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Logon par ek zamana aaega jab aadmi ko aajzi aur burai ke darmiyan ikhtiyar diya jayega.'"
"843","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Is ummat par koi azab nahin hai; us ka azab us ke apne hathon mein hai. Un se poocha gaya: 'Us ka azab us ke apne hathon mein kaise ho sakta hai?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Kya Jang Siffeen azab na thi? Kya Jang Nahrawan azab na thi? Kya Jang Jamal azab na thi?' Rawi ne kaha: Main ne Abu Dawud (Rahimahullah) se kaha: Sa'd se yeh kis ne riwayat ki? Unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Abi Zaidah ne."
"844","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Qayamat qaim nahin hogi yahan tak ke tum un logon se jang karo jin ke joote baalon ke honge, aur tum un logon se jang karoge jin ke chehre chaude aur naak chapte honge, goya un ke chehre tah dar tah dhalon ki manind hain.'"
"845","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Qayamat ke qareeb tum un logon se jang karoge jin ke joote baalon ke honge; tum un logon se jang karoge jin ke chehre chapte, aankhen chhoti hongi, goya un ke chehre teh ki hui dhalon ki manind hain. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Agar tum mein se koi apni peeth par lakdiyon ka gathha uthae, use beche, us se be-niyaz ho jae, us mein se sadaqa kare, aur us mein se khae, to woh us ke liye us shakhs ke paas jane aur us se mangne se behtar hoga, chahe woh de ya roke. Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai, aur apne zere kifalat logon par kharch se shuru karo. Rozedar ke munh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se behtar hai.'"
"846","[AI-translation] Qais bin Abi Hazim se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath aae to ham un ke samne hazir hue. To ham un ke paas gae, aur unhon ne un se kaha: Yeh log tumhare paas aae hain taake tum unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees sunao. To unhon ne pichli ki manind riwayat zikr ki, aur unhon ne kaha: 'Surkh chehron wale, chhoti aankhon wale.' Aur unhon ne kaha: 'Rozedar ke munh ki boo.'"
"847","[AI-translation] Asim bin Kulaib se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe bataya ke main Kufah ki masjid mein Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath baitha tha, ke ek aadmi un ke paas aaya aur kaha: 'Kya tum kahte ho ke tum Isa bin Maryam (Alaihissalam) ke sath namaz padhoge?' Unhon ne jawab diya: 'Aey Ahle Iraq! Main janta tha ke tum mere bare mein husn zan nahin rakhoge, lekin yeh mujhe tumhen woh batane se nahin rokta jo sachche aur ameen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen bataya: Dajjal mashriq se logon ki ek jama'at mein se zahir hoga aur chalees dinon mein har jagah safar karega. Woh mominon par ghalba pane ki poori koshish karega. Us daur mein momin qahat se takleef uthayenge. Phir Isa bin Maryam (Alaihissalam) nazil honge aur woh un ki imamat mein namaz padhayenge. Jab woh ruku se apna sar uthayenge to Allah Ta'ala Dajjal aur us ke sathiyon ko halak farmayega. Raha mera yeh kahna ke woh sach hai, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh sach hai. Aur raha mera yeh kahna: Mujhe ummeed hai ke main us waqt tak pahunchunga, shayad main pahunch jaun. Tum mere baalon mein safedi, mere jism mein kamzori, aur mera budhapa dekhte ho. Allah mujh par rahm farmaye, agar main un tak pahunchun aur un (Isa Alaihissalam) ke sath namaz padhun. Apni qaum ki taraf wapas jao aur unhen batao jo Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne tumhen is ke bare mein bataya hai.' Us aadmi ne poocha: 'Yeh kahan hoga?' To unhon ne masjid se chand kankariyan uthain aur kaha: 'Yahan se.' Us aadmi ne sawal dohraya, to unhon ne kaha: 'Kya tum chahte ho ke main kahun Kufah ki masjid se? Woh zameen se niklega, is se pahle ke woh badal jae (yani Qayamat se pahle), aur Allah use jahan chahega banayega.'"
"848","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Amanatdar par (khiyanat ka) ilzam lagaya jayega, ghair amanatdar ko amanatdar kaha jayega, jhoote ko sachcha samjha jayega aur sachche ko jhoota samjha jayega, aur «شرف جور» tum par nazil hoga.' Unhon ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah! «شرف جور» se kya murad hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Fitan andheri raat ke tukdon ki manind nazil honge.'"
"849","[AI-translation] Musa bin Ali apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: Main hajj ke liye nikla, to Salim bin Itr — jo Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhu) ke daur mein aur us ke baad Ahle Misr ke qazi the — ne mujhe waseeyat ki ke main Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko un ka salam pahunchayun, aur unhon ne kaha: Kal main ne un ke walidain ke liye bakhshish ki dua ki. To jab main Madina mein Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se mila to main ne unhen salam pahunchaya, aur unhon ne kaha: Kal main ne un ke liye aur un ke ghar walon ke liye bakhshish ki dua ki. Phir unhon ne kaha: Tum Umm Khunur (Misr) ko kis haal mein chhod aae? Hamen us ki haalat batao. Unhon ne kaha: Pahla fasad us sarzameen mein uthega, phir us ke baad Armenia mein. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un se kaha: Kya tum ne yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: Phir aur kis se, Ka'b do kitabon wale?"
"850","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek bhediya bakriyon ke charwahe ke paas aaya aur rewad mein se ek bakri pakad li. Charwahe ne us ka peecha kiya aur bakri ko us se bacha liya. Bhediya teele par baitha aur kaha: Main ne rizq ka irada kiya tha jo Allah ne mujhe ata farmaya tha, lekin tum ne use mujh se chheen liya. Us aadmi ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main ne aaj jaisa bhediya bolte kabhi nahin dekha. Bhediye ne kaha: Kya is se ziyada ta'ajjub ki baat nahin ke do pathreeli zameenon ke darmiyan, khajooron ke baghat mein ek aadmi hai jo tumhen guzishta aur aainda waqiyat ke bare mein batata hai? Rawi ne kaha: Woh aadmi Yahudi tha. Woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko bataya, phir Islam le aaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki tasdeeq farmai aur farmaya: 'Yeh Qayamat ke waqoo se pahle nishaniyon mein se hai. Qareeb hai ke aadmi apne ghar se nikle aur jab woh wapas aae to us ka joota use bataye ke kya hua, aur us ka koda use bataye ke us ke ghar walon ne us ke baad kya kiya.'"
"851","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is ummat ki halakat aur barbadi Quraish mein se na-samajh jawan ladkon ke hathon hogi.'"
"852","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Chhe cheezon ke waqoo se pahle naik a'mal mein jaldi karo: dabbatul arz ka nikalna, suraj ka maghrib se tulu hona, Dajjal ka aana, dhuwen ka zahir hona, maut ke aane se pahle, aur fitnon ke zahir hone se pahle.'"
"853","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qayamat badtareen logon par qaim hogi.'"
"854","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah ne tumhen teen cheezon se mahfooz rakha hai: ke tum sab gumrahi par jama nahin hoge, ke batil wale haq walon par ghalib nahin aayenge, aur ke main ne tumhare liye dua ki hai ke Woh tumhen halak na kare; aur un ke badle Us ne tumhen teen cheezen din hain: dhuwan, Dajjal, aur dabbatul arz (woh makhlooq jo zameen se niklegi).'"
"855","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Qayamat qaim nahin hogi yahan tak ke tum phenka hua joota dekho, aur ek aadmi kahe: Goya woh Quraishi joota hai.'"
"856","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Qayamat qaim nahin hogi yahan tak ke taqreeban tees aurten ek mard ke peeche paden, woh sab kahti hongi: Mujh se nikah karo, mujh se nikah karo, mujh se nikah karo.'"
"857","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Qayamat ke din se pahle andheri raat ke tukdon ki manind fitne honge. Un fitnon mein aadmi subah momin hoga aur shaam kafir; aur agar woh shaam momin ho to subah kafir hoga. Un mein log apna deen duniya ke thode hisse aur maal ke badle bechenge.'"
"858","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Sirf do bulandiyan hain: khair ki bulandi aur shar ki bulandi. To tum mein se kisi ko shar ki bulandi khair ki bulandi se ziyada mahboob na ho.'"
"859","[AI-translation] Is sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ne tumhen teen cheezon se hifazat ata farmai hai: ke tum sab gumrahi par muttafiq nahin hoge, batil tum par ghalib nahin aayega, aur tum aisi dua nahin karoge ke tum sab halak ho jao. Lekin tumhare liye: Dajjal, dhuwan, aur dabbatul arz lazim hain.'"
"860","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kufr ka sar mashriq ki taraf se hai.'"
"861","[AI-translation] Aur isi se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Meri ummat mein se ek giroh Allah ke raste mein jaddojahad karta rahega; jo un ki mukhalifat karenge woh unhen nuqsan nahin pahunchayenge yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm aa jae jabke woh ghalib honge.'"
"862","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Duniya khatm nahin hogi yahan tak ke ek aadmi qabr ke paas se guzre aur kahe: Kaash yeh meri qabr hoti! Woh yeh deen ki wajah se nahin kahega, balke (dunyawi) takleefon ki wajah se.'"
"863","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Dabbatul arz niklega, us ke sath Musa (Alaihissalam) ka aasa aur Sulaiman (Alaihissalam) ki anguthi hogi. Aase se momin ka chehra roshan kiya jayega; aur anguthi se kafir ki naak par mohar lagai jayegi. Log dastarkhwan par jama honge, aur woh (dabba) kahega: Yeh momin hai; aur kahega: Yeh kafir hai.'"
"864","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Paanch cheezen zahir hongi; in nishaniyon mein se jo pahle waqoo ho, us waqt kisi jaan ka iman use nafa nahin dega agar us ne pahle iman nahin laya tha: (woh nishaniyan) suraj ka maghrib se tulu hona, Dajjal, Yajooj aur Majooj, dhuwan, aur dabbe ka zahir hona hain.'"
"865","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aaj Yajooj aur Majooj ki rukawat mein is tarah surakh kiya gaya hai.' Rawi, Mumeel, ne apne hath se dus ka halqa banaya."
"866","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main aainda fitne ke bare mein janta hun, lekin main us se nikalne ka rasta nahin janta. Un se poocha gaya: Us se nikalne ka rasta kya hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: Ke mujhe mere hath se is tarah pakda jae yahan tak ke ek aadmi mere paas aae aur mujhe qatl kare."
"867","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek din Hind ka zikr farmaya aur farmaya: 'Tumhare lashkar ka ek giroh Hind par hamla karega, aur Allah unhen fath ata farmayega, yahan tak ke woh Sindh ke badshahon ko zanjeeron mein layenge. Allah un ke gunah bakhsh dega. Jab woh wapas aayenge to woh Isa bin Maryam (Isa Maryam ke bete) ko Shaam mein payenge.' Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Agar main us muhim ko dekhne ke liye zinda raha to main apni sawari aur apna maal bechunga aur us muhim mein shareek hunga. Jab Allah hamen fath ata farmayega aur ham wapas aayenge to main Abu Hurairah hunga, jahannam se aazad, Shaam ki taraf wapas aata hua. Woh (yani Isa bin Maryam Alaihissalam) un se milenge; to main un se qareeb hone aur unhen batane ki bahut koshish karunga ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath raha hun. Rawi ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muskuraye aur farmaya: 'Un ka doosra aana pahle aane jaisa nahin hoga. Woh maut jaisa rob dalenge. Woh murdon ke chehron ka masah farmayenge aur unhen jannat ke darjon ke bare mein batayenge.'"
"868","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke ghar mein the aur Asma (Raziyallahu anha) aata goondh rahi thin, ke unhon ne Dajjal ka zikr kiya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us ke zahoor se ek saal pahle aasman se teesri barish rok li jayegi, aur zameen apni teesri nabatat nahin ugaegi. Doosre saal mein aasman apni do tehayi barish rok lega, aur zameen apni do tehayi nabatat nahin ugaegi. Aur teesre saal mein aasman apni tamam barish rok lega, aur zameen kisi qism ki nabatat nahin ugaegi, yahan tak ke koi maweshi waghaira baqi nahin rahenge. Sab se bada fitna yeh hoga ke woh ek aadmi se kahega: Mujhe batao, agar main tumhare walid ya tumhare bhai ko tumhare liye zinda kar dun to kya tum janoge ke main tumhara Rabb hun? Woh kahega: Han. Woh ek dehati se kahega: Mujhe batao, agar main tumhari oontni ko tumhare liye zinda kar dun, us ka kohaan pahle se lamba aur than pahle se bade hon, to kya tum janoge ke main tumhara Rabb hun? Woh kahega: Han. Phir woh shaitanon ko un ki suraton mein zahir karega, jabke woh haqeeqat mein murdon ko zinda nahin kar sakta.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kisi kaam ke liye bahar tashreef le gae, aur jab wapas aae to Aap ke muazzaz sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ro rahe the. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne darwaze ki chaukhat pakdi aur farmaya: 'Khamosh ho jao.' Asma (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Unhen Dajjal ka zikr sunaya gaya hai, aur woh un par bhari hua hai. Allah ki qasam! Ham fikrmand hain jabke Aap ham mein hain; hamari kya haalat hogi jab Aap ham mein nahin honge? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar woh (Dajjal) zahir ho jabke main tum mein hun to main tumhari taraf se us se bahas aur munazra karunga. Aur agar woh mere baad zahir ho to Allah har momin par mera janasheen hai.' Asma (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us din logon ke liye khane mein kya kafi hoga? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo aasman walon ke liye tasbeeh aur taqdees mein kafi hai.'"
"869","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma, Yazid Ansariyyah (Raziyallahu anha) ki beti se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere ghar tashreef laae jabke main aata goondh rahi thi. Aap ne farmaya: 'Dajjal se pahle teen saal honge; pahle saal mein aasman apni teesri barish rok lega, aur zameen apni teesri nabatat rok legi.' Phir unhon ne pichli hadees ki manind bayan ki, aur oonton ke bare mein unhon ne kaha: 'Shaitan un ke liye un ki suraton mein zahir honge jaise un ki oontniyan, balke un ki pichli haalat se behtar, aur un ke than pahle se bahut bade honge.' Aur unhon ne kaha: 'Woh baapon aur beton (bachchon) ki surat ikhtiyar karega.' Aur unhon ne kaha: 'Tamam gaayen aur oontniyan halak ho jayengi.' Asma (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham aata goondhte hain lekin roti nahin pakate yahan tak ke ham bhooke mahsoos karte hain; us din mominon ki kya haalat hogi? Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo aasman walon ke liye tasbeeh aur taqdees mein kafi hai woh unhen kafi hoga.'"
"870","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid Ash'ariyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne sahaba mein farmate suna: 'Main tumhen Maseeh Dajjal se khabardar karta hun, aur har nabi ne apni qaum ko us se khabardar kiya hai. Aey Ummat! Woh tum mein hoga. Main use tumhen aise wazeh tareeqe se bayan karta hun ke mujh se pahle kisi nabi ne aise bayan nahin kiya. Us ke zahoor se pahle paanch saal qahat hoga, yahan tak ke un mein tamam maweshi halak ho jayenge.' Ek aadmi ne Aap ko pukara aur poocha: Ya Rasulullah! Us din mominon ke liye khane mein kya kafi hoga? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo farishton ke liye kafi hai woh unhen kafi hoga. Phir woh (Dajjal) niklega jabke woh kana hai, aur Allah kana nahin hai. Us ki peshani par Kafir likha hoga, aur har padha likha aur anpadh use padhega. Us ke aksar pairokaron mein Yahudi, dehati, aur aurten hongi. Tum aasman se barish baraste dekhoge, lekin woh barish nahin barsayega. Tum zameen ko nabatat ugate dekhoge, lekin woh nahin ugaegi. Woh dehatiyon se kahega: Tum mujh se kya chahte ho? Kya main ne tumhare liye khoob barish nahin barsai? Kya main ne tumhare liye tumhare maweshi zinda nahin kiye, jo mote hain, un ke pet nikle hue, aur un ke than doodh se bhare hue?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Shaitan unhen un ke baapon, bhaiyon, aur doston ki suraton mein dikhega. To ek aadmi apne baap, apne bhai, ya apne rishtedar ke paas aayega, aur woh us se kahega: Kya tum falan nahin ho? Kya tum meri tasdeeq nahin karte? Woh tumhara Rabb hai, to us ki pairwi karo. Woh (Dajjal) chalees saal rahega: ek saal mahine ki manind, ek mahina hafte ki manind, ek hafta din ki manind, aur ek din aag ki chingari ki manind. Woh har darre par jayega siwae donon masjidon (Makkah aur Madina) ke.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wuzu karne ke liye khade hue, aur Aap ne apne muazzaz sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum ajma'een) ke rone aur aaho zari suni. To Aap wapas aae aur farmaya: 'Khush ho jao! Agar woh zahir ho jabke main tum mein hun to Allah aur Us ke Rasool tumhare liye kafi hain. Aur agar woh mere baad zahir ho to Allah tum mein mera janasheen hai.'"
"871","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Dajjal zameen mein chalees saal rahega; ek saal mahine ki manind, ek mahina hafte ki manind, ek hafta din ki manind, aur ek din aag ki lapak ki manind.'"
"872","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Malik Bahziyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne fitnon ka zikr farmaya, aur farmaya: 'Un fitnon mein tum mein se behtareen woh hai jo apna maal le aur alag ho jae, apne Rabb ki ibadat kare, aur Us ka haq ada kare. Aur doosra woh hai jise dushman nahin janta aur woh unhen nahin janta.'"
"873","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas tashreef laae, aur main ne pahchana ke kisi cheez ne Aap ko jaldi par ubhara hai. Aap ne kisi se baat nahin ki, lekin wuzu farmaya aur bahar tashreef le gae. Main ne Aap ko hujron mein se farmate suna: 'Allah farmata hai: Aey logon! Neki ka hukm do aur burai se mana karo is se pahle ke ek waqt aae jab tum Allah se dua mango aur Woh tumhari dua qabool na farmaye, tum Us se mango aur Woh tumhen ata na farmaye, aur tum Us se madad mango aur Woh tumhari madad na farmaye.'"
"874","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fatimah bint Qais (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Har nabi ne (apni ummat ko) Dajjal ke fitne se khabardar kiya hai. Aey Ummat! Woh tum mein zahir hoga, lekin woh Taybah (Madina Munawwarah) ke siwa tamam zameen mein ghumega.'"
"875","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fatimah bint Qais (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek martaba mimbar par muskurate hue baithe, aur farmaya: 'Tamim Dari (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujhe ek baat batai hai jis ne mujhe khush kiya hai, to main ne chaha ke tumhen bhi bataun, taake tum bhi us se khush ho jis se tumhare Nabi khush hain. Us ne mujhe bataya ke Falasteen mein se chand log samandar mein kashti mein sawar hue, aur us ne unhen samandar ke ek jazeere tak pahuncha kar wahan utar diya. Wahan unhon ne ek janwar dekha jis ka libas baalon ka bana tha. Unhon ne kaha: Tum kaun ho? Us ne kaha: Main Jassasah hun. Unhon ne kaha: Hamen kisi cheez ke bare mein batao. Us ne kaha: Main tumhen kisi cheez ke bare mein nahin bataungi aur na tum se kuch poochungi, lekin is basti ke sab se door kinare jao; wahan koi hai jo tumhen batayega aur tum se poochega. Ham basti ke sab se door kinare pahunche aur wahan ek aadmi zanjeeron mein jakda tha. Us ne kaha: Mujhe Zughar ke chashme ke bare mein batao. Ham ne kaha: Woh bhara hua aur ubal raha hai. Us ne kaha: Mujhe Tabariya ki jheel ke bare mein batao. Ham ne kaha: Woh bhari hui aur ubal rahi hai. Us ne kaha: Mujhe Baisan ki khajooron ke bare mein batao, jo Falasteen aur Urdun ke darmiyan hai, kya woh phal deti hain? Ham ne kaha: Han. Us ne kaha: Mujhe is ummi Arab Nabi ke bare mein batao, kya woh tum mein zahir hue hain? Ham ne kaha: Han. Us ne kaha: Kya log Islam mein dakhil ho rahe hain? Ham ne kaha: Tezi se. Woh itni zor se uchhla ke woh apni zanjeeren todne ke qareeb tha. Ham ne kaha: Tum kaun ho? Us ne kaha: Main Dajjal hun. Woh Tayyibah ke siwa tamam shahron mein dakhil hoga.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh Tayyibah hai.' Aap ne use teen martaba farmaya, yani Madina Munawwarah."
"876","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fatimah bint Qais (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek din dopahar mein tashreef laae, aur yeh woh waqt tha jab Aap aam tor par tashreef nahin late. Aap mimbar par baithe aur farmaya: 'Aey logon! Main is waqt yahan tumhen koi targheeb ya dhamki dene ke liye nahin khada hua, lekin Tamim Dari mere paas aae aur mujhe aisi khabar sunai ke khushi aur aankhon ki thandak se main dopahar ka aaram bhi nahin kar saka. Main ne chaha ke tumhen tumhare Nabi ki khushi pahunchayun. Woh mere paas aae aur mujhe bataya ke un ke chand chacha zad samandari safar par nikle; toofan ne unhen gher liya aur unhen ek namaloom jazeere tak pahunchaya. Woh chhoti kashtiyon mein safar karke sahil tak pahunche. Wahan unhon ne badi palkon, ghane baalon, aur kaali jild wali makhlooq dekhi. Woh nahin jante the ke woh mard hai ya aurat. Unhon ne us se kaha: Tum kaun ho? Us ne kaha: Main Jassasah hun. Unhon ne us se kaha: Kya tum hamen kisi cheez ke bare mein nahin bataogi? Us ne kaha: Main tumhen kisi cheez ke bare mein nahin bataungi aur na poochungi, lekin us mandir mein jis ke qareeb tum ho, wahan koi hai jo tumhen kisi cheez ke bare mein batane ka aur tum se poochhne ka mushtaq hai (to wahan jao). Woh mandir gae aur wahan ek hasti dekhi jo kas kar bandhi hui thi. Woh bahut pareshan dikhai diya aur gehri aanhen bhar raha tha. Unhon ne use salam kiya, aur us ne un ke salam ka jawab diya. Phir us ne un se kaha: Tum kahan se ho? Ham ne kaha: Shaam se. Us ne kaha: Arbon ki kya haalat hai? Kya un ke Nabi zahir hue hain? Unhon ne kaha: Han. Us ne kaha: Un ki kya haalat hai? Kya un ki qaum ne un ki mukhalifat ki, aur Allah ne unhen un par fath ata farmai? Unhon ne kaha: Han. Us ne kaha: Kya Arab ab is haal mein hain ke un ka Khuda ek hai, aur un ki baat ek hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han. Us ne kaha: Yeh un ke liye behtar hai. Us ne kaha: Uman aur Baisan ke darmiyan khajooron ke baghat ki kya haalat hai? Unhon ne kaha: Woh theek hain aur har saal phal dete hain. Us ne kaha: Zughar ke chashme ki kya haalat hai? Unhon ne kaha: Woh theek hai; wahan ke log us mein se khud peete hain aur apne kheton aur baghat ko us se sairab karte hain. Us ne kaha: Tabariya ki jheel ki kya haalat hai? Unhon ne kaha: Woh bhari hui hai, pani ki kasrat se donon kinaron se ubal rahi hai. Us ne gehri aah bhari, phir qasam khai aur kaha: Agar main is qaid se riha hun to main tamam zameen ko apne paon tale rondunga. Phir us ne gehri aah bhari aur kaha: Siwae Taybah (Madina Munawwarah) ke, mujhe us par koi qudrat nahin hogi.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh sunkar meri khushi ki koi had nahin rahi. Yeh Taybah hai. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Yeh Taybah hai. Allah ne mere haram ko Dajjal par haraam farmaya hai.' Phir Aap ne qasam kha kar farmaya: 'Qayamat tak, khinchi talwar wala farishta pahra dega; Dajjal us mein dakhil nahin ho sakta.'"
"877","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Do haram: Makkah aur Madina us (Dajjal) par haraam hain.'"
"878","[AI-translation] Sha'bi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Muharrar bin Abi Hurairah se mila, to main ne unhen Fatimah bint Qais (Raziyallahu anha) ki riwayat sunai. Unhon ne kaha: Main apne walid ke sath tha jab unhon ne mujhe yeh hadees bilkul waisi sunai jaisi Fatimah bint Qais (Raziyallahu anha) ne tumhen sunai hai; unhon ne us mein se ek harf bhi nahin chhoda. Mere walid ne us mein ek bab ka izafa kiya; unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne hath se mashriq ki taraf taqreeban bees martaba lakeer khinchi."
"879","[AI-translation] Abu Usamah ne kaha: Jis ne Aamir se suna us ne mujhe hadees sunai; us ne hadees mein izafa bayan kiya: ke unhon ne us se poocha: Kya logon ne baad mein sawab taiyar kiya, aur is mein hai ke us ne apne paon ko apne paon ke andaruni hisse se thonka, aur is mein hai ke us ne kaha: Kya Yaman ki taraf se hai, phir us ne kaha: Nahin, balke Inan ki taraf se hai."
"880","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salamah bint Hurr (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Logon par ek waqt aayega jab woh ek muddat khade rahenge, lekin unhen imamat karane wala koi imam nahin milega.'"
"881","[AI-translation] Abdur Razzaq bin Hammam bin Nafi' San'ani se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne walid ko baaz ulama se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Namaz ki iqamat kahi jayegi, aur log imamat ke liye ek doosre ko aage badhayenge. To yeh us se kahega: Aage badho, aur woh is se kahega: Aage badho, yahan tak ke unhen zameen nigal legi."
